WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.818 --> 00:00:13.620
&gt;&gt; Laura: I HAVE A LITTLE RING

00:00:13.052 --> 00:00:16.856
THAT THEY GAVE ME LAST NIGHT.

00:00:13.753 --> 00:00:17.290
IT IS THE MONDAY BEFORE

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:20.827
ASH WEDNESDAY.

00:00:17.424 --> 00:00:23.597
IT WAS UNBELIEVABLE.

00:00:20.961 --> 00:00:27.734
50TH ANNIVERSARY RENDEZVOUS,

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:28.935
WATCHING MORE THAN 30 FLOATS AND

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:29.503
MARCHING BANDS COMING INTO THE

00:00:29.069 --> 00:00:29.903
CONVENTION CENTER AT

00:00:29.636 --> 00:00:32.439
NEW ORLEANS.

00:00:30.036 --> 00:00:33.106
IT WAS UNBELIEVABLE, ONE OF THE

00:00:32.572 --> 00:00:36.209
SERIAL EXPERIENCES THAT YOU

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:40.948
REALLY HAVE TO SEE.

00:00:36.343 --> 00:00:41.882
HE FOUND ANOTHER CREW DEDICATED

00:00:41.081 --> 00:00:44.117
TO HONORING OUR VETERANS AND

00:00:42.015 --> 00:00:48.522
TRANSFORMING THEIR LIVES.

00:00:44.251 --> 00:00:49.356
WATCH.

00:00:48.655 --> 00:00:51.525
♫ ♫

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:52.393
&gt;&gt; IN NEW ORLEANS, ALONG THE

00:00:51.658 --> 00:00:55.496
MISSISSIPPI, A PREPARADE A PARTY

00:00:52.526 --> 00:00:56.797
IS UNDERWAY.

00:00:55.629 --> 00:01:01.035
THESE ARE MEMBERS OF A

00:00:56.930 --> 00:01:04.271
MARDI GRAS GROUP.

00:01:01.168 --> 00:01:04.972
THE HOST PARADES AND UNDERTAKE

00:01:04.405 --> 00:01:07.908
PHILANTHROPIC WORKS THROUGHOUT

00:01:05.105 --> 00:01:08.943
THE YEAR.

00:01:08.042 --> 00:01:12.313
THEY WERE FOUNDED UP BY A GROUP

00:01:09.076 --> 00:01:13.414
OF LAWYERS FROM NEW ORLEANS.

00:01:12.446 --> 00:01:16.050
HE WAS ONE OF THEM.

00:01:13.547 --> 00:01:20.721
&gt;&gt; A FEW OF US HAVE RETURNED

00:01:16.183 --> 00:01:22.256
FROM ACTIVE DUTY OF SERVING, AND

00:01:20.855 --> 00:01:23.224
THERE WERE NO CRUISE AROUND THAT

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:23.724
WOULD ACTUALLY HONOR JUST A

00:01:23.357 --> 00:01:26.360
MILITARY.

00:01:23.858 --> 00:01:28.529
AND WITH SO MANY PEOPLE SERVING

00:01:26.494 --> 00:01:29.497
OVERSEAS, WE WANTED TO HAVE FUN,

00:01:28.663 --> 00:01:32.400
BUT WE WANTED TO DO SOMETHING

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.168
THAT WOULD HONOR THE MILITARY.

00:01:32.533 --> 00:01:35.603
A FALLEN SOLDIER, WOUNDED

00:01:34.302 --> 00:01:39.440
WARRIORS, SO MANY THINGS.

00:01:35.737 --> 00:01:40.341
&gt;&gt; THE ORGANIZATION ROLLING

00:01:39.574 --> 00:01:45.580
THROUGH THE USE OF STREETS.

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:47.782
THIS ONLY ONE, DEDICATED IT TO

00:01:45.713 --> 00:01:48.149
CELEBRATING AND POPULATED BY

00:01:47.916 --> 00:01:50.018
VETERANS.

00:01:48.283 --> 00:01:50.518
&gt;&gt; AS HE CAN SEE, RAIN OR SHINE,

00:01:50.151 --> 00:01:53.621
THEY ARE ROLLING.

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:54.489
A LITTLE RAN COULD NOT STOP THIS

00:01:53.755 --> 00:01:56.157
CREW.

00:01:54.622 --> 00:01:59.494
MANY OF THE WRITERS HAVE SEEN

00:01:56.291 --> 00:02:00.896
COMBAT IN IRAQ, AFGHANISTAN, AND

00:01:59.628 --> 00:02:02.697
VIETNAM.

00:02:01.029 --> 00:02:04.533
FOR SOME, IT IS NOT JUST A

00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:08.904
PARADE, BUT AN EXPERIENCE OF JOY

00:02:04.666 --> 00:02:10.138
AND HEALING.

00:02:09.037 --> 00:02:13.108
FRED AND BILL SERVED IN VIETNAM

00:02:10.272 --> 00:02:16.945
TOGETHER, BUT IT WAS THE LEGION

00:02:13.241 --> 00:02:21.516
OF MOBS THAT REUNITED THEM AND

00:02:17.079 --> 00:02:23.118
TO CHANGE THEM THE BETTER.

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:28.524
&gt;&gt; EVERYONE KNOWS HOW WE WERE

00:02:23.252 --> 00:02:29.424
TREATED AND ALL OF THAT STUFF,

00:02:28.657 --> 00:02:33.662
PTSD, SO MY WIFE’S THOUGHTS THAT

00:02:29.558 --> 00:02:35.330
IT WOULD BE A GOOD IDEA FOR ME,

00:02:33.796 --> 00:02:38.300
PERSONALLY, TO JOIN A GROUP THAT

00:02:35.464 --> 00:02:39.101
WAS CATERING TO VETS.

00:02:38.434 --> 00:02:40.069
AND IT HAS.

00:02:39.234 --> 00:02:42.304
IT HAS BEEN A BLESSING.

00:02:40.202 --> 00:02:45.507
IT HAS KIND OF BROUGHT ME OUT OF

00:02:42.438 --> 00:02:46.509
MY SHELL, GAVE ME AN OPPORTUNITY

00:02:45.641 --> 00:02:47.843
TO MEET FOLKS.

00:02:46.642 --> 00:02:49.678
AND I FEEL A LOT MORE

00:02:47.977 --> 00:02:52.515
COMFORTABLE BEING AROUND

00:02:49.812 --> 00:02:53.883
VETERANS.

00:02:52.648 --> 00:02:56.085
AND ACTIVE MILITARY, SO WE NOT

